<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Page Layout</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #90d4e8; /* light blue */
    }

    /* Header bar */
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background-color: #6689b7; /* blue header */
      padding: 15px 40px;
      height: 80px;
      border-bottom: 5px solid #29b8e2; /* bright blue line */
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    /* Title on the left */
    .title {
      color: black;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* Navigation buttons */
    .nav-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .nav-buttons button {
      background-color: #90a9d4;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-buttons button:hover {
      background-color: #7d97c8;
      color: white;
    }

    /* Main content area */
    .container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 40px;
    }

    /* Text box area */
    .text-box {
      width: 60%;
      min-height: 300px;
      border: 3px solid black;
      background-color: #90d4e8;
      padding: 20px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Feedback button */
    .feedback {
      margin-left: 40px;
      background-color: #3f43c4;
      color: black;
      border: none;
      width: 200px;
      height: 100px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .feedback:hover {
      background-color: #2e33a8;
      color: white;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="title">STAYING SAFE ONLINE</div>
    <div class="nav-buttons">
      <li><a href="page2">how 2 stay safe</a></li>
      <li><a href="page4">sources</a></li>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-box">
      This is a website about staying safe online please select reasources above and give feedback if you would like to and stay safe
    </div>
    <li><a href="page3">feedback</a></li>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
